   "sourceHash": "04c6f6808dc33ae1bb11c413f0388f95b15ef7a9bf9656b65dcb25aee7e50efa",
   "text": "在特殊情况下办理退款，须经管理层批准，并扣除已产生的不可退还费用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ff68bbe2e2386988281b",
   "sourceHash": "ff68bbe2e2386988281bc43810bac0e9001f03f7e683e8c20d9bc648e9d222ee",
   "text": "办理退款",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_32a6345a93a26700043b",
   "sourceHash": "32a6345a93a26700043b9a1188ce458bd281c5627ac8b9575d1891817a2ad82f",
   "text": "（仅限特殊情况），须经管理层批准，并扣除已产生的不可退还费用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d751b2f3bc69fb5fc393",
   "sourceHash": "d751b2f3bc69fb5fc393a5adbf6e081be9141607292014d95054ee5887072d93",
   "text": "遇到此类情况，建议患者及访客联系我们的预订团队，了解可选方案。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source 'Guests' rendered as 患者及访客 (patients and visitors) per the banned-word rule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_12bc9e9fffb5babce7db",
   "sourceHash": "12bc9e9fffb5babce7dbae59f7755e9e73670c6a5ecc2270d1228e782296855d",
   "text": "感谢您理解并配合遵守上述政策。如需进一步协助或有任何疑问，请联系我们的支持团队。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_325f5ed96c5f2a0f5ab0",
   "sourceHash": "325f5ed96c5f2a0f5ab0c2c813151acd25d90df3c4e74208ed3bad492eeeae87",
   "text": "法定权利与说明",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_507353c4685ea45af145",
   "sourceHash": "507353c4685ea45af145c73f34fe6af2cdcf7341f590b7ecb0719af391cc32a8",
   "text": "本条款不影响患者或消费者依法享有的强制性权利。如报价单、收费标准PDF与网站条款之间存在差异，请在付款前要求团队以书面形式予以核对确认。退款到账时间还取决于银行或支付服务提供商。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a5723e1c796aac7d6626",
   "sourceHash": "a5723e1c796aac7d6626a31dd72b792158391bd50bc9edd84ec369ff65c570b1",
   "text": "Cookie 政策 | Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cec63b1e2110d4cf0284",
   "sourceHash": "cec63b1e2110d4cf028466bd5ad68725ff9a341a434c9242fe271c278b80f2ec",
   "text": "了解 Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村如何使用 Cookie 改善用户体验、衡量网站表现并提供个性化内容。您可随时管理 Cookie 设置。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_595194d787f621b8624d",
   "sourceHash": "595194d787f621b8624dc6419770888e6689b4b9d6a0f12b74ad8a8524871488",
   "text": "Cookie 政策 — 更新于2026年9月25日",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a4784a9df2cfc884002e",
   "sourceHash": "a4784a9df2cfc884002e924116da2305e15a96089f7d0a317e8fc1a18f3f1c7f",
   "text": "Cookie 及类似的浏览器存储可用于保障安全、记住您的选择，并在获得必要许可后衡量网站使用情况。仅访问或继续浏览本网站，并不表示您同意使用可选 Cookie。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5bf4a92fb60d2717ad12",
   "sourceHash": "5bf4a92fb60d2717ad121c4d4630925427f6594ded43ec50a6dfa1c8c30065aa",
   "text": "您的选择",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2a16c39354bf8fb5602f",
   "sourceHash": "2a16c39354bf8fb5602f031708ae047823e8fa413362b1b1c1461497bee4a6fb",
   "text": "请在 Cookie 提示中选择“接受”或“拒绝”。拒绝可选的统计衡量不应妨碍您阅读疗程信息或联系医院。您可使用本页上的“Cookie 选项”控件撤回已保存的选择，页面将在拒绝可选同意的状态下重新加载。您也可以在浏览器中管理已存储的 Cookie。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f5ffee0ad1e0f7c39fcf",
   "sourceHash": "f5ffee0ad1e0f7c39fcff0df7545e7679a14d6139f92f528386b0a507d5262ab",
   "text": "必要存储",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_956c63d7a6313029d285",
   "sourceHash": "956c63d7a6313029d2853f354b907547cade9df278aae4a73976e6acfb42ade3",
   "text": "本网站将 Cookie 偏好保存在浏览器本地存储中，包括 ktahv-consent 和 kairali-consent-v1。安全或会话功能可能会使用必要存储。浏览器设置可能会影响这些功能。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2441dd767e11a83d632d",
   "sourceHash": "2441dd767e11a83d632d01c6b2ca8716229003367e7f83b892b2af5a13dbe0c4",
   "text": "可选统计衡量",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c5021c1f0e5d3c105dd2",
   "sourceHash": "c5021c1f0e5d3c105dd2e38f8c569f533f594967c09a47a2d9005dab96c3c7c5",
   "text": "在正式环境启用统计衡量时，本网站包含 Google Analytics、Microsoft Clarity 和 Meta 的集成。可选脚本必须遵循您的同意选择。接受 Cookie 并不代表允许将医疗报告、咨询内容、身份标识信息或您输入的健康相关搜索发送给广告或分析服务。基于健康信息的个性化广告需另行评估，并受广告平台规则限制。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9d8d05b9736daf8d0191",
   "sourceHash": "9d8d05b9736daf8d0191f31d1877ca6ba941a7c388bde5cd7db91ad93f6709ad",
   "text": "外部服务",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_de147f941d02869c0d82",
   "sourceHash": "de147f941d02869c0d82e3cb4721a3f768593c2821d1cb9a2246522dcaba8429",
   "text": "打开 WhatsApp、Priya 聊天、支付服务、地图或视频时，您可能会连接到第三方。该第三方服务适用其自身的隐私和 Cookie 规则。并非所有第三方存储项都受医院 Cookie 横幅的控制。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
